		{
			dependencies: ["30A0ACC1C6D738A8"]
			description: [
				"在这个奇异的新维度中，你可以找到旧式矢量算子。&r（In this strange new dimension you can find Old Vector Operators.&r）"
				"将它们放在六面体内部的三个插座上，即可前往新的维度。&r（Placing them onto the three plugs inside the Hexahedron will allow you to travel to new dimensions.&r）"
				""
				"每个旧式矢量算子&r（Each of the Old Vector Operators &r）"
				"都会使数值加 1。例如，连续放置两个算子就会将你送往维度 2。&r（adds +1. So for example, two in a row will send you to dimension 2.&r）"
				""
				"{image:kubejs:textures/questbook/book_images/vectors.png width:154 height:122 align:center}"
			]
			id: "43823F2E6C3DD6A1"
			rewards: [{
