			description: [
				"按住默认的 &o波浪号&r键（~），即可同时挖掘大量相邻且类型相同的方块。&r（While holding the default &otilde&r key (~) you can mine a lot of adjacent blocks at once as long as they are of the same type. &r）"
				""
				"这个实用工具可以减少任务中的重复劳动。&r（This is quite a handy tool that prevents tasks from becoming to grindy.&r）"
				""
				"你可以在控制设置的 FTB Ultimine 分类中重新绑定该按键。&r（You can rebind this key in the controls menu under \"FTB Ultimine\".&r）"
