			description: [
				"使用 FTB 地图可以强制加载区块，使设施在你离开所在区域后仍能运行。&r（Using the FTB map you can force load chunks so that setups work even when you are not currently present in that specific area.&r）"
				""
				"点击物品栏界面左上角的第二个地图图标，即可认领区块。&r（Simply click the second map icon in the top left of your inventory screen. There you will be able to claim chunks.&r）"
				""
				"在地图上按住 Shift 并右键点击已加载的区块，即可强制加载它们。&r（You can shift right-click on loaded chunks on the map to force load them.&r）"
